# SO §6.9(5) AMENDED 2026-02-23 · bundle-based continuity mechanism (owner drop banked at
# STATE/OWNER_DROPS/so_6_9_clause_5_bundle_amendment_20260223/DROP.md)
# New continuity bundles at every milestone seal are off-pod DELIVERABLES, not tracked in
# the state repo. sha256-pins live in STATE/PINS.md (tracked). Historic pre-amendment
# bundles remain tracked (gitignore does not untrack). No credentials, no push, nothing public.
